<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12773" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dē-glūbo</span></b> , no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>, ptum, 3,
				<i>v. a., to peel off; to shell, to husk</i>.
			* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">granum eo folliculo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 1, 48, 2</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>To take off the skin; to skin, flay</i> (rare): se
			vel vivum, Varr. ap. <i><span class="en">Non. 158, 22</span></i>; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">maenam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Poen. 5, 5, 33</span></i>
			: pecus, Tiber. ap. <i><span class="en">Suet.
				Tib. 32 <i>fin.</i></span></i>: murem, Marc. Empir. 16
				<i>med.</i>—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b> In an obscene sense,
					<i><span class="en">Aus. Epigr. 71, 5</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
